<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Comerica raised by NatWest.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Comerica raised by NatWest.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it upgraded Comerica Inc to trading buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe the stock will begin to discount an anticipated improvement in the company's earnings power,&quot; the brokerage said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1/4 at 52-3/4.</p>
</text>
